<p class="md-p">先按次数记录目标需求，再维护已达标的字符种类。某种字符刚好达到需求才增加 valid；覆盖成立时先记录最短长度，再尝试移出左端。下面保留的实现要求目标串非空，没有写空目标的提前返回。</p>
<p class="md-p">解法：</p>
<div class="md-list-wrap"><ul class="md-list md-depth-0"><li><code class="tok-inline">need</code> 记录目标字符需求。</li><li><code class="tok-inline">window</code> 记录当前窗口。</li><li>当窗口满足所有需求时，尝试收缩左端。</li></ul></div>
<p class="md-p">输入格式：第一行字符串 s，第二行字符串 t。 输出格式：最小覆盖子串（若不存在输出空串）。</p>
<section class="code-card md-code-card"><div class="code-toolbar"><div class="toolbar-left"><span class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="file-label">字符串与子串总结.java</span></div><button class="copy-button md-copy" type="button">复制代码</button></div><div class="code-scroll"><pre class="md-pre" data-lang="java">import java.util.*;

public class Main {
    public static String solve(String s, String t) {
        // need 记录 t 中各字符的需求数量，window 记录当前窗口内各字符数量
        Map&lt;Character, Integer&gt; need = new HashMap&lt;&gt;(), window = new HashMap&lt;&gt;();
        for (char c : t.toCharArray()) {
            need.merge(c, 1, Integer::sum);
        }
        int left = 0, valid = 0, start = 0, len = Integer.MAX_VALUE;
        for (int right = 0; right &lt; s.length(); right++) {
            char c = s.charAt(right);
            if (need.containsKey(c)) {
                window.merge(c, 1, Integer::sum);
                // 当某个字符的数量刚好满足需求时，valid 加一
                if (window.get(c).equals(need.get(c))) {
                    valid++;
                }
            }
            // 所有字符都满足时，尝试收缩左端找更短的子串
            while (valid == need.size()) {
                if (right - left + 1 &lt; len) {
                    start = left;
                    len = right - left + 1;
                }
                char d = s.charAt(left);
                left++;
                if (need.containsKey(d)) {
                    if (window.get(d).equals(need.get(d))) {
                        valid--;
                    }
                    window.merge(d, -1, Integer::sum);
                }
            }
        }
        return len == Integer.MAX_VALUE ? &quot;&quot; : s.substring(start, start + len);
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);
        String s = sc.nextLine();
        String t = sc.nextLine();
        System.out.println(solve(s, t));
    }
}</pre></div></section>